    {
      "gameKey": "custom/000/CmnBhtRewardLv020St0003_00025#TEXT_CMNBHTREWARDLV020ST0003_00025_RET_TALK_00",
      "en": "The operation was a success! Here's your reward, and don't let anyone tell you that you didn't earn it.",
